{"id": "EUVD-2026-80079", "enisaUuid": "12b92c4d-64c1-3cf3-a019-27451715896b", "description": "@jitsi/electron-sdk before 10.0.5 exposes getDesktopSources() via contextBridge without requiring an active getDisplayMedia() picker, allowing any script in the meeting page to enumerate screens and windows. Attackers can call the jitsi-screen-sharing-get-sources IPC route to retrieve desktop thumbnails at arbitrary resolution without user consent or operating system permission prompts.", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T01:57:46", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-16T18:41:32", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/jitsi/jitsi-meet-electron-sdk/pull/516", "https://github.com/jitsi/jitsi-meet-electron-sdk/commit/144080fdddad2d11f7380475d4ac9bcf379cd035", "https://github.com/jitsi/jitsi-meet-electron-sdk/blob/002dae740e63a225c0bc8ed7bd53ed7ce104ebc8/screensharing/main.js#L93-L96", "https://github.com/jitsi/jitsi-meet-electron-sdk/blob/v10.0.5/screensharing/main.js#L131-L137", "https://github.com/jitsi/jitsi-meet-electron-sdk", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jitsi-electron-sdk-before-10.0.5-unauthorized-screen-capture"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-92299", "GHSA-q3gq-fmhq-w6pr"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.48, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3f0baf2b-8e7f-3b38-8a0a-e63103a2d64a", "product": {"name": "@jitsi/electron-sdk", "vendor": {"name": "jitsi"}}, "product_version": "0 <10.0.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "aa314010-4fb1-3feb-aef9-2cda919b1534", "vendor": {"name": "jitsi"}}], "isExploited": false}